{"seq":2,"slug":"type-inference","title":"类型推断与 Hindley-Milner","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ocaml-functional-systems/foundations/type-inference","wordCount":1528,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型推断与-hindley-milner\">类型推断与 Hindley-Milner</h1><p>第一次写 OCaml 的人常被一件事震到：你写 <code>let twice f x = f (f x)</code>，什么类型都没标，编译器却回报 <code>(&#39;a -&gt; &#39;a) -&gt; &#39;a -&gt; &#39;a</code>，精确得近乎读心。这不是魔法，而是 Hindley-Milner（HM）类型推断——一套由 Roger Hindley 和 Robin Milner 在上世纪七十年代独立发现、被 Damas 和 Milner 严格化的算法。它的核心承诺是：在它覆盖的语言子集内，每个能通过类型检查的程序都有唯一的「最一般类型」（principal type），而且这个类型能被自动、完整地推断出来，无需任何标注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>HM 推断的工作方式可以拆成三步：为表达式里的未知类型引入类型变量，根据语言的类型规则在这些变量之间生成等式约束，再用「合一」（unification）算法求解这组约束。求解的结果若一致，就得到程序的类型；若矛盾，就是一条类型错误。let 绑定处的「泛化」（generalization）则负责把推断出的单态类型提升为可在多处以不同方式实例化的多态类型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[源表达式] --&gt; B[引入类型变量&lt;br/&gt;每个未知类型一个]&#10;  B --&gt; C[按类型规则&lt;br/&gt;生成约束等式]&#10;  C --&gt; D[合一算法求解约束]&#10;  D --&gt; E{约束一致?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[在 let 处泛化&lt;br/&gt;得到最一般类型]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[报类型错误]&#10;  F --&gt; H[多处实例化&lt;br/&gt;得到具体类型]\">flowchart TD\n  A[源表达式] --&gt; B[引入类型变量&lt;br/&gt;每个未知类型一个]\n  B --&gt; C[按类型规则&lt;br/&gt;生成约束等式]\n  C --&gt; D[合一算法求解约束]\n  D --&gt; E{约束一致?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[在 let 处泛化&lt;br/&gt;得到最一般类型]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[报类型错误]\n  F --&gt; H[多处实例化&lt;br/&gt;得到具体类型]</pre><p>下表对比 HM 推断与其他几种类型推断策略的能力边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Hindley-Milner</th>\n<th>局部推断（Rust/C#）</th>\n<th>全程标注（Java 旧版）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推断范围</td>\n<td>全局、整个函数</td>\n<td>局部、表达式级</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最一般类型</td>\n<td>保证存在且唯一</td>\n<td>不保证</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数参数标注</td>\n<td>通常不需要</td>\n<td>通常需要</td>\n<td>总是需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高阶多态</td>\n<td>不支持（需 GADT/标注）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算法复杂度</td>\n<td>最坏指数，实际近线性</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"类型变量与约束生成\">类型变量与约束生成</h2><p>推断从给每个未知类型起一个名字开始。考虑 <code>let apply f x = f x</code>：编译器给 <code>f</code> 一个类型变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、给 <code>x</code> 一个变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>。看到 <code>f x</code> 这个应用，它知道 <code>f</code> 必须是一个函数类型，于是要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = \\beta \\to \\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是应用结果的类型。整个函数的类型就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\to \\beta \\to \\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>，代入约束后化简为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\beta \\to \\gamma) \\to \\beta \\to \\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 改写成 <code>&#39;a</code>、<code>&#39;b</code>，就是 OCaml 报给你的 <code>(&#39;a -&gt; &#39;b) -&gt; &#39;a -&gt; &#39;b</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let apply f x = f x&#10;(* val apply : (&#39;a -&gt; &#39;b) -&gt; &#39;a -&gt; &#39;b *)&#10;&#10;let compose f g x = f (g x)&#10;(* val compose : (&#39;a -&gt; &#39;b) -&gt; (&#39;c -&gt; &#39;a) -&gt; &#39;c -&gt; &#39;b *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let apply f x = f x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* val apply : ('a -> 'b) -> 'a -> 'b *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let compose f g x = f (g x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* val compose : ('a -> 'b) -> ('c -> 'a) -> 'c -> 'b *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键在于：编译器从不猜测，它只是机械地收集每个使用点强加的约束，再解出唯一满足所有约束的最宽松类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合一-让两个类型相等\">合一：让两个类型相等</h2><p>合一是 HM 的引擎。给定两个可能含类型变量的类型，合一算法寻找一个变量替换，使两者变得完全相同。合一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">t</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\to \\mathtt{int}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathtt\">int</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">l</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathtt{bool} \\to \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathtt\">bool</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 会得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">l</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = \\mathtt{bool}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathtt\">bool</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">t</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta = \\mathtt{int}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathtt\">int</span></span></span></span></span></span>。若要合一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathtt{int}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathtt\">int</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathtt{bool}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathtt\">bool</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则无解——这就是一条类型错误。</p>\n<p>合一里有一个容易忽略却至关重要的步骤：occurs check（出现检查）。当算法试图让某个类型变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 等于一个包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 自身的类型（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = \\alpha \\to \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）时，它必须拒绝，否则会构造出无限的递归类型。这正是为什么 <code>let f x = x x</code> 会被 OCaml 拒绝——<code>x</code> 既要是函数又要是它自己的参数，occurs check 把它挡了下来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"let-多态-泛化与实例化\">let 多态：泛化与实例化</h2><p>如果只有合一，类型系统会过于僵硬：一个 <code>let id x = x</code> 一旦在某处用于 <code>int</code>，就会被永久钉死成 <code>int -&gt; int</code>。HM 的精髓在 let 绑定处的泛化。当编译器为 <code>id</code> 推断出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\to \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，它发现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 不被外部环境约束，于是把它「泛化」成一个全称量化的类型方案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall \\alpha.\\ \\alpha \\to \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>。此后每次使用 <code>id</code>，都会取这个方案的一个新鲜实例，所以 <code>id 3</code> 与 <code>id &quot;hi&quot;</code> 可以共存。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let id x = x          (* val id : &#39;a -&gt; &#39;a，已泛化 *)&#10;let _ = id 3          (* 这里实例化为 int -&gt; int *)&#10;let _ = id &quot;hello&quot;    (* 这里实例化为 string -&gt; string *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let id x = x          (* val id : 'a -> 'a，已泛化 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let _ = id 3          (* 这里实例化为 int -> int *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let _ = id \"hello\"    (* 这里实例化为 string -> string *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种「在 let 处泛化、在使用处实例化」的机制叫 let 多态，是 HM 区别于朴素类型推断的核心。它解释了为什么 OCaml 函数天然是多态的——这种参数多态的更深入讨论见 <a href=\"../functional/polymorphism-gadts\">多态与 GADT</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"值限制-为什么有些类型推不出来\">值限制：为什么有些类型推不出来</h2><p>HM 在纯函数世界里完美无缺，但 OCaml 允许副作用，这会带来不安全。考虑 <code>let r = ref []</code>：如果编译器把它泛化成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"monospace\">f</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall \\alpha.\\ \\alpha\\ \\mathtt{list\\ ref}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathtt\">list</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathtt\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span>，你就能先往里塞一个 <code>int</code>、再当成 <code>string list</code> 读出来，类型安全瞬间崩塌。OCaml 的解法是值限制（value restriction）：只有当 let 绑定的右侧是一个「语法值」（变量、函数、常量等不触发计算的表达式）时，才进行泛化；像 <code>ref []</code> 这样是函数调用结果的表达式不被泛化，它的类型变量保持单态，等待后续使用点把它定下来。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let r = ref []        (* &#39;_weak1 list ref，弱类型变量，未泛化 *)&#10;let () = r := [1]     (* 这一步把它定为 int list ref *)&#10;(* 此后 r 永远是 int list ref，不能再当 string list ref 用 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let r = ref []        (* '_weak1 list ref，弱类型变量，未泛化 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let () = r := [1]     (* 这一步把它定为 int list ref *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 此后 r 永远是 int list ref，不能再当 string list ref 用 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>那个带下划线的 <code>&#39;_weak1</code> 就是未泛化的弱类型变量，它是值限制留下的痕迹。理解它能省下无数面对「这个值类型不够泛化」报错时的困惑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推断的边界与显式标注的时机\">推断的边界与显式标注的时机</h2><p>HM 的强大是有代价的：它放弃了高阶多态（让函数参数本身是多态的）。当你确实需要时，OCaml 提供显式的高阶多态标注和 GADT 来突破这个边界，后者见 <a href=\"../functional/polymorphism-gadts\">多态与 GADT</a>。此外，模块系统里的类型也常需要在签名中显式声明——推断负责函数体内部，签名负责模块边界，两者分工明确，详见 <a href=\"../functional/modules-functors\">模块与函子</a>。日常工程里，给公开函数加上类型标注也是好习惯：它不改变推断结果，但能让错误定位更精准、让接口意图更清晰。这种「编辑器里随时看到推断类型」的体验由 Merlin 提供，见 <a href=\"../ecosystem/tooling-merlin\">工具链与 Merlin</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Hindley-Milner 推断保证每个合法程序有唯一的最一般类型，并能自动推断，无需标注。</li>\n<li>推断分三步：引入类型变量、生成约束、用合一求解；occurs check 阻止无限递归类型。</li>\n<li>let 多态在绑定处泛化、在使用处实例化，是 OCaml 函数天然多态的根源。</li>\n<li>值限制为应对副作用而生：非语法值不泛化，留下 <code>&#39;_weak</code> 弱类型变量。</li>\n<li>HM 不支持高阶多态，需要时用显式标注或 GADT 突破；模块边界则靠签名而非推断。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型推断与 Hindley-Milner","id":"类型推断与-hindley-milner"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"类型变量与约束生成","id":"类型变量与约束生成"},{"level":2,"text":"合一：让两个类型相等","id":"合一-让两个类型相等"},{"level":2,"text":"let 多态：泛化与实例化","id":"let-多态-泛化与实例化"},{"level":2,"text":"值限制：为什么有些类型推不出来","id":"值限制-为什么有些类型推不出来"},{"level":2,"text":"推断的边界与显式标注的时机","id":"推断的边界与显式标注的时机"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OCaml 设计哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ocaml-functional-systems/foundations/ocaml-philosophy"},"next":{"title":"模式匹配与代数数据类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ocaml-functional-systems/foundations/pattern-matching-adts"}}